 Autisme is a mobile application that will educate autistic children’s English numbers and letters by using 
recent technologies to facilitate autistic children learning through an interactive environment .

Supervisor: Dr. Sahar Bayoumi

Scrum Master (SM):Dr. Hend AlRasheed

Stakeholders: Children With Autism

